irect Cypher MERGE/CREATE/DELETE on tenant-owned labels must go through AuditedGraphMutation.\nThis bypasses the audited mutation gateway which enforces tenant isolation, audit logging, and metrics.\nUse AuditedGraphMutation.write_relationship(), write_node(), delete_relationship(), or delete_node() instead.\n"}, "id": "semgrep.block-direct-graph-mutation", "name": "semgrep.block-direct-graph-mutation", "properties": {"precision": "very-high", "tags": ["OWASP-A01:2021 - Broken Access Control"]}, "shortDescription": {"text": "Semgrep Finding: semgrep.block-direct-graph-mutation"}}, {"defaultConfiguration": {"level": "error"}, "fullDescription": {"text": "Dynamic Cypher label interpolation detected. Node labels cannot be parameterized in Cypher ? they must be validated against an explicit allowlist before interpolation. Either use a hardcoded string literal, or validate the variable against an allowlist (e.g. _ALLOWED_TARGET_LABELS, validate_cypher_identifier) and annotate with:\n  # cypher-dynamic-safe: validated against <ALLOWLIST>\n"}, "help": {"markdown": "Dynamic Cypher label interpolation detected. Node labels cannot be parameterized in Cypher ? they must be validated against an explicit allowlist before interpolation. Either use a hardcoded string literal, or validate the variable against an allowlist (e.g. _ALLOWED_TARGET_LABELS, validate_cypher_identifier) and annotate with:\n  # cypher-dynamic-safe: validated against <ALLOWLIST>\n", "text": "Dynamic Cypher label interpolation detected. Node labels cannot be parameterized in Cypher ? they must be validated against an explicit allowlist before interpolation. Either use a hardcoded string literal, or validate the variable against an allowlist (e.g. _ALLOWED_TARGET_LABELS, validate_cypher_identifier) and annotate with:\n  # cypher-dynamic-safe: validated against <ALLOWLIST>\n"}, "id": "semgrep.cypher-dynamic-label-injection", "name": "semgrep.cypher-dynamic-label-injection", "properties": {"precision": "very-hig