lated into a query. Verify that all elements are hardcoded string literals. If confirmed safe, annotate with: # cypher-dynamic-safe: set_clauses are hardcoded literals\n", "text": "Dynamic Cypher SET clause assembled via string join and interpolated into a query. Verify that all elements are hardcoded string literals. If confirmed safe, annotate with: # cypher-dynamic-safe: set_clauses are hardcoded literals\n"}, "id": "semgrep.cypher-dynamic-set-clause", "name": "semgrep.cypher-dynamic-set-clause", "properties": {"precision": "very-high", "tags": ["CWE-943: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements in Data Query Logic", "security"]}, "shortDescription": {"text": "Semgrep Finding: semgrep.cypher-dynamic-set-clause"}}, {"defaultConfiguration": {"level": "warning"}, "fullDescription": {"text": "Dynamic Cypher WHERE clause assembled via string join and interpolated into a query. Verify that all elements of the joined list are hardcoded string literals (never user-controlled values). If confirmed safe, annotate the query line with: # cypher-dynamic-safe: where_clauses are hardcoded literals\n"}, "help": {"markdown": "Dynamic Cypher WHERE clause assembled via string join and interpolated into a query. Verify that all elements of the joined list are hardcoded string literals (never user-controlled values). If confirmed safe, annotate the query line with: # cypher-dynamic-safe: where_clauses are hardcoded literals\n", "text": "Dynamic Cypher WHERE clause assembled via string join and interpolated into a query. Verify that all elements of the joined list are hardcoded string literals (never user-controlled values). If confirmed safe, annotate the query line with: # cypher-dynamic-safe: where_clauses are hardcoded literals\n"}, "id": "semgrep.cypher-dynamic-where-clause", "name": "semgrep.cypher-dynamic-where-clause", "properties": {"precision": "very-high", "tags": ["CWE-943: Improper Neutralization of Special Elements in Data Query Logic", "security"]}, "shortDescription": {"text": "Semgrep Finding: semgrep.cypher-dynamic-where-clause"}}, {"defaultConfiguration": {"level": "warning"}, "fullDescription": {"text": "Do not pass raw `str(exc)` into Celery task stage updates or DB fields. Store a stable error code or sanitized message.\n"}, "help": {"markdown": "Do not pass raw `str(exc)` into Celery task stage updates or DB fields. Store a stable error code or sanitized message.\n", "text": "Do not pass raw `str(exc)` into Celery task stage updates or DB fields. Store a stable error code or sanitized message.\n"}, "id": "semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-celery-stage", "name": "semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-celery-stage", "properties": {"precision": "very-high", "tags": []}, "shortDescription": {"text": "Semgrep Finding: semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-celery-stage"}}, {"defaultConfiguration": {"level": "warning"}, "fullDescription": {"text": "Do not return raw `str(exc)` in health-check JSON responses. Use a stable status code and generic message.\n"}, "help": {"markdown": "Do not return raw `str(exc)` in health-check JSON responses. Use a stable status code and generic message.\n", "text": "Do not return raw `str(exc)` in health-check JSON responses. Use a stable status code and generic message.\n"}, "id": "semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-health-check", "name": "semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-health-check", "properties": {"precision": "very-high", "tags": []}, "shortDescription": {"text": "Semgrep Finding: semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-health-check"}}, {"defaultConfiguration": {"level": "warning"}, "fullDescription": {"text": "Do not pass raw `str(e)` into logger `extra=` dicts. Use `sanitize_log_error(e)` from `value_fabric.shared.error_handling` and include a stable `error_code`.\n"}, "help": {"markdown": "Do not pass raw `str(e)` into logger `extra=` dicts. Use `sanitize_log_error(e)` from `value_fabric.shared.error_handling` and include a stable `error_code`.\n", "text": "Do not pass raw `str(e)` into logger `extra=` dicts. Use `sanitize_log_error(e)` from `value_fabric.shared.error_handling` and include a stable `error_code`.\n"}, "id": "semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-logger-extra", "name": "semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-logger-extra", "properties": {"precision": "very-high", "tags": []}, "shortDescription": {"text": "Semgrep Finding: semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-logger-extra"}}, {"defaultConfiguration": {"level": "error"}, "fullDescription": {"text": "Do not put raw `str(e)` into internal result/error dicts that may reach the frontend or other services. Use a stable error code and generic message; log the full exception server-side with `exc_info=True`.\n"}, "help": {"markdown": "Do not put raw `str(e)` into internal result/error dicts that may reach the frontend or other services. Use a stable error code and generic message; log the full exception server-side with `exc_info=True`.\n", "text": "Do not put raw `str(e)` into internal result/error dicts that may reach the frontend or other services. Use a stable error code and generic message; log the full exception server-side with `exc_info=True`.\n"}, "id": "semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-result-dict", "name": "semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-result-dict", "properties": {"precision": "very-high", "tags": []}, "shortDescription": {"text": "Semgrep Finding: semgrep.error-str-leakage-in-result-dict"}}], "semanticVersion": "1.175.0"}}}], "$schema": "https://docs.oasis-open.org/sarif/sarif/v2.1.0/os/schemas/sarif-schema-2.1.0.json"}
